itten in DIMACS and the proof, binary DRAT, is read back from the\n   solver's trace file;''')\nrep('''would mean the stored optimum is wrong, and is recorded as `sat`, never\nsilently. A call the deadline interrupts is `timeout`: censored, not missing.''',\n'''would mean the stored optimum is wrong, and is recorded as `sat`, never\nsilently. A call that exhausts its conflict budget is `budget`, one the wall\ndeadline kills is `timeout`: both censored, neither missing.''')\nrep('''    python -m learning.proofs run --max-customers 40 --workers 16 --deadline 120''',\n'''    python -m learning.proofs run --max-customers 40 --workers 16 --conflicts 1000000 --deadline 180''')\n\n# --- table columns and certificate fields\nrep('''    \"solve_seconds\", \"check_seconds\", \"deadline_seconds\", \"backend\",''',\n'''    \"solve_seconds\", \"check_seconds\", \"conflict_budget\", \"conflicts\",\n    \"decisions\", \"deadline_seconds\", \"backend\",''')\nrep('''    deadline_seconds: float | None = None\n    backend: str = BACKEND''',\n'''    conflict_budget: int | None = None\n    conflicts: int = 0\n    decisions: int = 0\n    deadline_seconds: float | None = None\n    backend: str = BACKEND''')\nrep('''    \"\"\"`unsat` (proof stored), `sat` (stored optimum contradicted), `timeout`.\"\"\"''',\n'''    \"\"\"`unsat` (proof stored), `sat` (stored optimum contradicted), `budget`\n    (conflict budget exhausted), `timeout` (killed at the wall deadline).\"\"\"''')\n\n# --- the solve/check split\nstart = s.index(\"def refute_with_proof(\")\nend = s.index(\"def rebuild_cnf(\")\nnew_block = '''def solve_with_proof(\n    instance: MOSPInstance,\n    optimum: int,\n    source_file: str = \"\",\n    conflicts: int | None = None,\n    proof_dir: Path = PROOF_DIR,\n    backend: str = BACKEND,\n) -> ProofCertificate:\n    \"\"\"Refute `optimum - 1` through the SAT path, writing the proof but not checking it.\n\n    Mirrors `decide_mosp`: decompose, then drop dominated patterns within each\n